WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
The model follows a bounded release
test pack through eight stages.

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:07.520
The baseline adds to three hundred hours
of hands-on work over a ten-business-day

00:00:07.577 --> 00:00:11.200
window. That is human effort,
not elapsed waiting time.

00:00:11.274 --> 00:00:15.280
Requirements clarification,
data preparation, execution, triage

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:19.280
and evidence all contribute.
Before buying another tool,

00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:23.600
identify where people are repeating
work and where they are simply blocked.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:27.920
Those two problems require different
interventions and different measurements.
